@startuml communication_lifecycle
!theme cyborg
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
title COMMUNICATION lifecycle: from Wi-Fi join to delivery after Stop
hide empty description
state "Wi-Fi join\nboot join, link recovery or setup page" as Join
state "Idle network work (CONTROL lease)" as Idle {
 state "Idle check\nwhat is due?" as Check
 state "Connection preparation\none setup = SNTP exchange, DNS, TCP, TLS 1.3, verification\none deadline per setup" as Preparation
 state "Registration\nconditional POST /Device, validate, save record\none deadline per attempt" as Registration
 state "Prepared\nverified connection retained as reuse candidate\nregistration ready (record saved)" as Prepared
}
state "Listening (CONTROL)\nno network work: no request, no setup, no SNTP\nstation association retained\nverified TLS connection retained dormant" as Listening
state "Finalizing (CONTROL)\nresult frozen; no network work yet" as Finalizing
state "Delivery\nstarts when CONTROL submits the finalized job\none deadline from Stop (P13)\nreuse an eligible retained connection, else new setup" as Delivery
[*] --> Join
Join -down-> Check : station address
Check --> Preparation : transport unverified,\nserver profile valid, gap over
Check --> Registration : verified, no saved\nregistration for this server, gap over
Check --> Prepared : verified and registered
Preparation --> Check : failed setup: SERVER_CONNECTION_FAILURE,\nretried after a gap
Preparation --> Registration : verified; no saved\nregistration for this server
Preparation --> Prepared : verified; saved\nregistration matches
Registration --> Prepared : record committed
Registration --> Check : failed attempt: retried after a growing gap;\nattempts exhausted: unavailable until restart
Idle -down-> Listening : Start: pending services stopped,\nrelease acknowledged
Join --> Listening : Start: join cancelled
Listening -up-> Check : Stop before 15 s or no result:\nnothing sent
Listening -down-> Finalizing : Stop that enters finalization
Finalizing -up-> Check : no job: Wi-Fi unconfigured\nor DELIVERY_NOT_POSSIBLE
Finalizing -down-> Delivery : communication_submitDelivery
Delivery -up-> Check : job ends: receipt, DELIVERY_FAILURE or\nSERVER_CONNECTION_FAILURE (no clock)
Delivery -up-> Listening : Start cancels the job: DELIVERY_FAILURE, or\nSERVER_CONNECTION_FAILURE (no clock); result lost
@enduml
